<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><ncx xmlns="http://www.daisy.org/z3986/2005/ncx/" version="2005-1" xml:lang="en"><head><meta name="dtb:uid" content="urn:uuid:f55dc49e-f9f6-48cb-8644-9f7a8cba7dd9"/><meta name="dtb:depth" content="2"/><meta name="dtb:totalPageCount" content="0"/><meta name="dtb:maxPageNumber" content="0"/></head><docTitle><text>Emergency Oil Reserves</text></docTitle><navMap><navPoint id="nav-1" playOrder="1"><navLabel><text>Introduction: Follow the fuel all the way</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch001.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-2" playOrder="2"><navLabel><text>1. From storage to diesel</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch002.xhtml"/><navPoint id="nav-3" playOrder="3"><navLabel><text>Two kinds of insurance in the tank</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch002.xhtml#c1-two-kinds-of-insurance-in-the-tank"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-4" playOrder="4"><navLabel><text>Refining determines which fuel becomes available</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch002.xhtml#c1-refining-determines-which-fuel-becomes-available"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-5" playOrder="5"><navLabel><text>The case for America&apos;s crude reserve</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch002.xhtml#c1-the-case-for-americas-crude-reserve"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-6" playOrder="6"><navLabel><text>SAGESS holds a substantial share as finished products</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch002.xhtml#c1-sagess-holds-a-substantial-share-as-finished-products"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-7" playOrder="7"><navLabel><text>“Days of cover” needs a denominator</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch002.xhtml#c1-days-of-cover-needs-a-denominator"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-8" playOrder="8"><navLabel><text>From a decision to an actual lifting</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch002.xhtml#c1-from-a-decision-to-an-actual-lifting"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-9" playOrder="9"><navLabel><text>The bottleneck determines the response</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch002.