nance-has-to-be-tested-through-contracts"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-21" playOrder="21"><navLabel><text>Further reading</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch003.xhtml#c2-further-reading"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-22" playOrder="22"><navLabel><text>Sources</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch003.xhtml#c2-sources"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-23" playOrder="23"><navLabel><text>Scope and method</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch003.xhtml#c2-scope-and-method"/></navPoint></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-24" playOrder="24"><navLabel><text>3. The remaining distance</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch004.xhtml"/><navPoint id="nav-25" playOrder="25"><navLabel><text>A same-day transfer still leaves a journey</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch004.xhtml#c3-a-same-day-transfer-still-leaves-a-journey"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-26" playOrder="26"><navLabel><text>Location is decided before the emergency</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch004.xhtml#c3-location-is-decided-before-the-emergency"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-27" playOrder="27"><navLabel><text>At the depot, the constraint is a flow rate</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch004.xhtml#c3-at-the-depot-the-constraint-is-a-flow-rate"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-28" playOrder="28"><navLabel><text>October 2022: intervention along the chain</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch004.xhtml#c3-october-2022-intervention-along-the-chain"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-29" playOrder="29"><navLabel><text>Availability at the pump is a separate measure</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch004.xhtml#c3-availability-at-the-pump-is-a-separate-measure"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-30" playOrder="30"><navLabel><text>Refilling tanks while customers empty them</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch004.xhtml#c3-refilling-tanks-while-customers-empty-them"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-31" playOrder="31"><navLabel><text>Flexibility has to be assessed over time</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch004.xhtml#c3-flexibility-has-to-be-assessed-over-time"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-32" playOrder="32"><navLabel><text>The missing link in public data</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch004.xhtml#c3-the-missing-link-in-public-data"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-33" playOrder="33"><navLabel><text>Further reading</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch004.xhtml#c3-further-reading"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-34" playOrder="34"><navLabel><text>Sources</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch004.xhtml#c3-sources"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-35" playOrder="35"><navLabel><text>Scope and method</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch004.xhtml#c3-scope-and-method"/></navPoint></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-36" playOrder="36"><navLabel><text>4. The refinery sets the pace</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch005.xhtml"/><navPoint id="nav-37" playOrder="37"><navLabel><text>The fuel takes shape across several units</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch005.xhtml#c4-the-fuel-takes-shape-across-several-units"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-38" playOrder="38"><navLabel><text>Hydrogen is already at work before refuelling</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch005.xhtml#c4-hydrogen-is-already-at-work-before-refuelling"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-39" playOrder="39"><navLabel><text>What a utilisation rate actually measures</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch005.xhtml#c4-what-a-utilisation-rate-actually-measures"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-40" playOrder="40"><navLabel><text>Donges’ notices trace a phased restart</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch005.xhtml#c4-donges-notices-trace-a-phased-restart"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-41" playOrder="41"><navLabel><text>Prices create incentives within an industrial boundary</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch005.xhtml#c4-prices-create-incentives-within-an-industrial-boundary"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-42" playOrder="42"><navLabel><text>France’s recovery still includes flows in both directions</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch005.xhtml#c4-